: "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Acme Supplies's approved invoice once, by wire, from the operating account.\n\n**Payment:**\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Invoice:** INV-96524 (was due 2026-11-04)\n- **Amount:** $7,555.41, the full invoice amount\n- **Method:** Wire\n- **Status:** Sent, and the invoice is now marked paid\n\nBefore sending, I checked that the operating account had no earlier payments, so this isn't a duplicate. I also attached a unique key to the request so it can't go through twice if it's resubmitted. The amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n\nI didn't touch Acme's other two invoices. INV-79388 was already paid, and INV-70645 ($2,196.57) is still a draft waiting for approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}